  m_Name: New QR Code Data 14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SafetyTraining.QRCodeData
  qrCodeID: "Arka Kap\u0131 G\xFCvenlik G\xF6stergesi"
  title: "Arka Kap\u0131 G\xFCvenlik G\xF6stergesi"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Arka Kap\u0131 G\xFCvenlik G\xF6stergesi, test arac\u0131n\u0131n arka
    kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n g\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde kapal\u0131 olup olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    g\xF6sterir. Arka kap\u0131 a\xE7\u0131k oldu\u011Funda g\xFCvenlik kilidi devreye
    girer ve y\xFCksek gerilim sisteminin enerjilendirilmesine izin verilmez. Kap\u0131n\u0131n
    tamamen kapal\u0131 ve kilitli oldu\u011Fu do\u011Fruland\u0131ktan sonra test
    sistemi \xE7al\u0131\u015Fmaya haz\u0131r hale gelir. Bu g\xF6sterge, personel
    g\xFCvenli\u011Fini sa\u011Flamak ve y\xFCksek gerilim alt\u0131nda yanl\u0131\u015Fl\u0131kla
    eri\u015Fimi \xF6nlemek amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131lan \xF6nemli g\xFCvenlik kontrollerinden
    biridir."
